  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Notice the pair of location words for 'Yakutia': coming 'from Yakutia' is 'iz Yakutii' (genitive), and being 'in Yakutia' is 'v Yakutii' (prepositional). See you in the next scene.",
   "gap": 0.5
